{"id":"f2f6e5380b315983","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-language.md","title":"Stratified First-Order Signatures","display":"df-language — Stratified First-Order Signatures","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-language","aliases":["90-df-language"],"display":"df-language — Stratified First-Order Signatures","depends_on":["[[90-df-omega]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-language — Stratified First-Order Signatures"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定互异逻辑标记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=,\\neg,\\land,\\forall\">\\(=,\\neg,\\land,\\forall\\)</span> 及可数变量符号表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\mapsto v_i\">\\(i\\mapsto v_i\\)</span> 为单射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 与逻辑标记不交。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>候选分层签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda=\\langle C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle\">\\(\\Lambda=\\langle C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle\\)</span>。各非逻辑符号集两两不交，且与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>、逻辑标记不交；零元函数归入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，不设零元关系。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>树构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(\\vec E)\">\\(a(\\vec E)\\)</span> 按下式表示为根标签与有限子树列的有序对。项或公式位置的叶 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a()\">\\(a()\\)</span> 沿用符号写法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>，这始终是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\mapsto\\langle a,\\epsilon\\rangle\">\\(a\\mapsto\\langle a,\\epsilon\\rangle\\)</span> 的类型化嵌入，不是有序对与标签的集合论等同。包含签名使用同一变量表及树构造子。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\ge1\">\\(m\\ge1\\)</span> 的式子取正元数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\operatorname{Lab}_\\Lambda\">\\(a,b\\in\\operatorname{Lab}_\\Lambda\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec E,\\vec H\\in\\operatorname{Tree}_\\Lambda^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\vec E,\\vec H\\in\\operatorname{Tree}_\\Lambda^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；带撇的三元组为同变量表的另一个候选分层签名。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Lambda=\\langle C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle\\land\n\\forall n\\ge1\\ (C\\cap F_n=C\\cap R_n=\\varnothing)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall n,m\\ge1\\ \\bigl[F_n\\cap R_m=\\varnothing\\land\n(n\\ne m\\Longrightarrow F_n\\cap F_m=R_n\\cap R_m=\\varnothing)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\Bigl(C\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}(F_n\\cup R_n)\\Bigr)\n\\cap(V\\cup\\{=,\\neg,\\land,\\forall\\})=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sym}_{\\Lambda}&amp;\\coloneqq C\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}(F_n\\cup R_n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Lab}_{\\Lambda}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Sym}_{\\Lambda}\\cup V\\cup\\{=,\\neg,\\land,\\forall\\},\\\\\na(\\vec E)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle a,\\vec E\\rangle,\\qquad a()\\coloneqq\\langle a,\\epsilon\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal T_\\Lambda(0)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{a():a\\in\\operatorname{Lab}_\\Lambda\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal T_\\Lambda(n+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal T_\\Lambda(n)\\cup\n\\{a(\\vec E):a\\in\\operatorname{Lab}_\\Lambda\\land\\vec E\\in\\mathcal T_\\Lambda(n)^{&lt;\\omega}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Tree}_\\Lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal T_\\Lambda(n),\\\\\na(\\vec E)=b(\\vec H)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow a=b\\land\\vec E=\\vec H,\\\\\n\\langle C,(F_n),(R_n)\\rangle\\subseteq\\langle C&#39;,(F&#39;_n),(R&#39;_n)\\rangle\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow C\\subseteq C&#39;\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\ (F_n\\subseteq F&#39;_n\\land R_n\\subseteq R&#39;_n).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Lambda=\\langle C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle\\land\n\\forall n\\ge1\\ (C\\cap F_n=C\\cap R_n=\\varnothing)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall n,m\\ge1\\ \\bigl[F_n\\cap R_m=\\varnothing\\land\n(n\\ne m\\Longrightarrow F_n\\cap F_m=R_n\\cap R_m=\\varnothing)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\Bigl(C\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}(F_n\\cup R_n)\\Bigr)\n\\cap(V\\cup\\{=,\\neg,\\land,\\forall\\})=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sym}_{\\Lambda}&amp;\\coloneqq C\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}(F_n\\cup R_n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Lab}_{\\Lambda}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Sym}_{\\Lambda}\\cup V\\cup\\{=,\\neg,\\land,\\forall\\},\\\\\na(\\vec E)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle a,\\vec E\\rangle,\\qquad a()\\coloneqq\\langle a,\\epsilon\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal T_\\Lambda(0)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{a():a\\in\\operatorname{Lab}_\\Lambda\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal T_\\Lambda(n+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal T_\\Lambda(n)\\cup\n\\{a(\\vec E):a\\in\\operatorname{Lab}_\\Lambda\\land\\vec E\\in\\mathcal T_\\Lambda(n)^{&lt;\\omega}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Tree}_\\Lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal T_\\Lambda(n),\\\\\na(\\vec E)=b(\\vec H)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow a=b\\land\\vec E=\\vec H,\\\\\n\\langle C,(F_n),(R_n)\\rangle\\subseteq\\langle C&#39;,(F&#39;_n),(R&#39;_n)\\rangle\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow C\\subseteq C&#39;\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\ (F_n\\subseteq F&#39;_n\\land R_n\\subseteq R&#39;_n).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件依据第 90 本实际调用的接口补齐未提供的外部依赖，供本书内部使用；不声称复原未提供的外部原文。 此文件只补足分层签名。第 90 本原扁平签名及其 sharp 翻译保留，不能直接把两个三元组逐分量相等。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"9846c377383d14c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-omega]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"=,\\neg,\\land,\\forall","display":false},{"tex":"V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\mapsto v_i","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda=\\langle C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"a(\\vec E)","display":false},{"tex":"a()","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"a\\mapsto\\langle a,\\epsilon\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"m\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in\\operatorname{Lab}_\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec E,\\vec H\\in\\operatorname{Tree}_\\Lambda^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Lambda=\\langle C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle\\land\n\\forall n\\ge1\\ (C\\cap F_n=C\\cap R_n=\\varnothing)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall n,m\\ge1\\ \\bigl[F_n\\cap R_m=\\varnothing\\land\n(n\\ne m\\Longrightarrow F_n\\cap F_m=R_n\\cap R_m=\\varnothing)\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\Bigl(C\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}(F_n\\cup R_n)\\Bigr)\n\\cap(V\\cup\\{=,\\neg,\\land,\\forall\\})=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sym}_{\\Lambda}&\\coloneqq C\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}(F_n\\cup R_n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Lab}_{\\Lambda}&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Sym}_{\\Lambda}\\cup V\\cup\\{=,\\neg,\\land,\\forall\\},\\\\\na(\\vec E)&\\coloneqq\\langle a,\\vec E\\rangle,\\qquad a()\\coloneqq\\langle a,\\epsilon\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal T_\\Lambda(0)&\\coloneqq\\{a():a\\in\\operatorname{Lab}_\\Lambda\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal T_\\Lambda(n+1)&\\coloneqq\\mathcal T_\\Lambda(n)\\cup\n\\{a(\\vec E):a\\in\\operatorname{Lab}_\\Lambda\\land\\vec E\\in\\mathcal T_\\Lambda(n)^{<\\omega}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Tree}_\\Lambda&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal T_\\Lambda(n),\\\\\na(\\vec E)=b(\\vec H)&\\Longleftrightarrow a=b\\land\\vec E=\\vec H,\\\\\n\\langle C,(F_n),(R_n)\\rangle\\subseteq\\langle C',(F'_n),(R'_n)\\rangle\n&\\Longleftrightarrow C\\subseteq C'\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\ (F_n\\subseteq F'_n\\land R_n\\subseteq R'_n).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2777,"backlinks":[{"id":"264cfff82242245c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"上标 $88$ 和下标 $88$ 是原调用接口的保留拼写，现均由第 90 本本地依赖定义，不要求读取外部文件：$\\mathrm{Var}^{88},\\mathrm{Term}^{88},\\mathrm{AtFml}^{88},\\mathrm{Fml}^{88},\\operatorname{var}^{88},\\operatorname{free}^{88},\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}$ 及在可代入域上的 $[t/x]_{88}$ 分别取 [[90-df-variable]]、[[90-df-term]]、[[90-df-atomic-formula]]、[[90-df-base-formula]]、[[90-df-base-free-variable]]、[[90-df-substitution]]；签名条件见 [[90-df-language]]。"},{"id":"242d776aa7405493","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8225a5a04158160a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda)$，共用的变量符号表和叶嵌入取 [[90-df-language]]。上标 $88$ 保留原调用的拼写，现由本书内部文件定义；它不要求读取第 88 本。"},{"id":"10ddd9c20c6edffd","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-language]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-173","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-